      "content": "## Surface Tension of Water in Contact with Air\n\nThis calculator provides surface tension values for water in contact with air across different temperature ranges using both Imperial (BG) and SI units.\n\n**Imperial Units (BG):** Surface tension in 10⁻³ lb/ft\n\n**SI Units:** Surface tension in 10⁻² N/m"
